::ALG1_U02_L01_Quiz_Q01::
Question ID:<br>ALG1_U02_L01_Q01<br><br>MLA Standard:<br>No new primary MLA standard; prerequisite support.<br><br>Question:<br>Solve x + 5 = 12. {
=A. x = 7#Correct. Subtract 5 from both sides.
~B. x = 17#This adds 5 instead of subtracting 5.
~C. x = 5#This is the number added to x, not the solution.
~D. x = 12#This repeats the right side without isolating x.
}

