::ALG1_U02_L01_Quiz_Q04::
Question ID:<br>ALG1_U02_L01_Q04<br><br>MLA Standard:<br>No new primary MLA standard; prerequisite support.<br><br>Question:<br>Solve <sup>m</sup>&frasl;<sub>5</sub> = 8. {
