::ALG1_U02_L01_Quiz_Q12::
Question ID:<br>ALG1_U02_L01_Q12<br><br>MLA Standard:<br>No new primary MLA standard; prerequisite support.<br><br>Question:<br>Solve <sup>v</sup>&frasl;<sub>-2</sub> = 9. {
