::ALG1_U02_L01_Quiz_Q19::
Question ID:<br>ALG1_U02_L01_Q19<br><br>MLA Standard:<br>No new primary MLA standard; prerequisite support.<br><br>Question:<br>Which value checks correctly for 6k = 30? {
~A. k = 24#6 times 24 is not 30.
~B. k = 36#6 times 36 is not 30.
